  "impact": {
    "areas": ["frontend", "api", "authorization", "customer-flow", "analytics"],
    "notes": [
      "Adds a chronological, business-isolated History view over authoritative Opportunities, Actions, Execution Kits and Outcomes without introducing duplicate History persistence.",
      "Supports status, category, goal and date filters in the API; the mobile MVP exposes status and category filters with bounded retrieval.",
      "History preserves exact Knowledge Pack provenance and reports factual learning summaries without causal attribution.",
      "Mobile History is an existing-shell route launched from Today’s Focus; no PES tab, navigation framework, authentication or state architecture changes were made.",
      "History cards deep-link to existing Opportunity Detail and support loading, empty, degraded/error and refresh states.",
      "Runtime remains disabled outside development/test; release, deployment and production enablement are not authorized."
    ]
  },
